Body:
Mistral just started to host GLM 5.3 recently, but opencode hadn't shown it yet.  
To ensure we always catch up, we can configure this way:
1. set `zai-glm-latest` in `opencode.jsonc`:
```jsonc
{
  "$schema": "https://opencode.ai/config.json",
  "provider": {
    "mistral-openai": {
      "name": "Mistral (OpenAI compatible)",
      "npm": "@ai-sdk/openai-compatible",
      "models": {
        "zai-glm-latest": {
          "name": "GLM-latest",
          "reasoning": true,
          "temperature": true,
          "tool_call": true,
          "limit": {
            "context": 1000000,
            "output": 131072
          },
          "modalities": {
            "input": ["text"],
            "output": ["text"]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "baseURL": "https://api.mistral.ai/v1"
      }
    }
  }
}
```

2. adjust the plugin `mistral-glm-model.ts` to allow all GLM models
